:MENUI OPTION=40 ACTION='MENU CMDSPLF'.Spooled File Commands  CMDSPLF
:EMENUGRP.
:EMENU.
:CMDLINE SIZE=LONG.Selection or command
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPCMDFILE.File Commands - Help
:P.File Commands: the commands and the command menus of this group, as the
major command menu arranges them, with each name at the right of its
row. A blank row is a command this release does not provide.
:P.Type an option number and press Enter to prompt the command or show the
menu, or type a command on the command line. F12 returns to the previous
menu, F3 to the menu where you started and F16 to the major command
groups.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
